+# Feature: createPatch(from, to)
+
+Exported from `src/index.ts`. Returns an RFC 6902 JSON Patch that turns `from` into `to` via `applyPatch`.
+
+- Neither input is mutated; values in the patch are copies (no aliasing).
+- Minimal: equal documents give `[]`; objects are diffed per member (add/remove/recurse); arrays trim the
+  common prefix/suffix, diff the overlapping middle element-wise, then remove/add the remainder.
+  Only differing primitives or type changes produce `replace` (root: path `""`).
+- Pointer tokens are escaped (`~0`, `~1`); keys such as `__proto__` are ordinary members.
+- Tests: `test/diff.test.ts`. The constitution is an unfilled template, so no further rules applied.
